WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.119 --> 00:00:02.959
The forces of healing,

00:00:02.959 --> 00:00:06.000
reconciliation and shared interest

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.439
that have inspired the construction of Europe

00:00:08.439 --> 00:00:11.920
are today increasingly transforming

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:14.200
the economic and political landscape

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.200
of the island of Ireland.

00:00:23.519 --> 00:00:26.039
My visit here to the European Parliament

00:00:26.039 --> 00:00:29.159
comes at a time of great hope and optimism

00:00:29.159 --> 00:00:31.879
on the island of Ireland.

00:00:31.879 --> 00:00:34.479
For the first time in a generation,

00:00:34.479 --> 00:00:37.280
it is free of paramilitary violence.

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:40.639
It is right to express here in this city,

00:00:40.639 --> 00:00:44.920
so symbolic of the spirit of European reconciliation,

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:47.879
deep appreciation for the consistent

00:00:47.879 --> 00:00:51.280
and unwavering support of the European Union.

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:53.879
Unemployment and poverty are like poisons

00:00:53.879 --> 00:00:56.159
which attack the social fabric.

00:00:56.159 --> 00:00:59.920
Failure to devise and implement radical solutions

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:02.879
to these problems undermines confidence.

00:01:04.239 --> 00:01:07.119
With power comes responsibility.

00:01:07.119 --> 00:01:09.519
And as a corollary to the importance

00:01:09.519 --> 00:01:11.519
and influence in the world,

00:01:11.519 --> 00:01:14.360
the Union is bound to exercise those powers

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:16.200
in a responsible fashion.

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:19.479
We owe it to those much less fortunate than ourselves

00:01:19.479 --> 00:01:22.119
to provide the means with which they can be freed

00:01:22.119 --> 00:01:24.920
from the debilitating cycle of war,

00:01:24.920 --> 00:01:26.519
famine and disease.

00:01:26.519 --> 00:01:29.119
It is incumbent on us to ensure

00:01:29.119 --> 00:01:32.400
that the causes and consequences of hunger and suffering

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:35.639
in the developing world are properly addressed.

00:01:37.159 --> 00:01:38.759
The old certainties have vanished

00:01:38.759 --> 00:01:40.439
with the collapse of communism,

00:01:40.439 --> 00:01:43.600
a unique historical opportunity has presented itself.

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:47.319
However, it is also important that relations with Russia

00:01:47.319 --> 00:01:50.280
should be based on respect for human rights

00:01:50.280 --> 00:01:53.959
and the principles of the United Nations and the OSCE.

00:01:53.959 --> 00:01:55.959
I am keenly aware

00:01:55.959 --> 00:01:58.519
that members of this body

00:01:58.519 --> 00:02:02.360
are working with foresight and commitment

00:02:02.360 --> 00:02:05.200
to build a permanent Europe!

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:08.879
Thank you for giving me this opportunity to address you.

